  {
   "id": "2120116075555942659",
   "text": "If I were Jeremy Latcham, the next DC film post MOT would be a soft reboot of the universe. By that I don\u2019t mean retcons just focus on what it\u2019s all leading to & I\u2019d do that with a Trinity movie which introduces our new Batman & new Wonder Woman (unless she debuts in MOT)",
   "url": "https://x.com/StebobM/status/2120116075555942659",
   "created_at": "2026-11-10T11:27:16+00:00",
   "sent_at": "2026-11-10T11:27:16+00:00",
   "author_name": "Man of Steven",
   "author_handle": "StebobM",
   "author_avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2116652994355728384/3Hs95nPA_normal.jpg",
   "reply_count": 0,
   "repost_count": 2,
   "like_count": 2,
   "image": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HWwqVUYXwAAmQ0q.jpg"
  },
  {
   "id": "2120095570463502801",
   "text": "That in itself is a problem too you have to build around the Trinity. Even if Batman was the first film in the DCU we\u2019d still be where we are now. Same if it was Wonder Woman. You need all 3 & then you go to characters like Flash, Aquaman, Green Lantern & so on.",
